{"synopsis":"Kehidupan desa Sierra yang damai terganggu ketika mantan pacarnya, Duke Cassius Ideos, muncul dan salah mengira anak yang dia besarkan sebagai putrinya. Masalahnya, gadis itu adalah keponakannya, bukan anaknya! Ketika dia menolak untuk mendengarkan penjelasan apa pun, satu-satunya pilihannya adalah mengikutinya ke kadipatennya dan menunggu hasil tes paternitas. Yang harus dilakukan Sierra adalah menjaga dirinya sendiri selama tiga bulan, tetapi apakah segalanya akan tetap sesederhana itu ketika dia mulai curiga bahwa sang adipati masih memiliki perasaan padanya?","alternative_title":"얘 우리 딸 아니에요!","author":"Doreda, Ponong","artist":"Akeo Studio, Abba (Akeo Studio), Kang Joo-Yeon (Akeo Studio)","chapters":[{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"897742e7-e698-45f2-8de6-4c4bbcaf28be","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"572250d3-8aad-4ac2-a117-5f7bb7c00262","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"18d10206-5ac7-4bd2-bb12-e9eb311087f5","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"a1242022-d2d2-4d1e-abda-c749cf6d6786","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"773461de-1b93-49a2-93e1-7be71852bbd2","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"08bc872b-13b5-41de-81f1-871d337a7657","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"0de3b5cf-3a75-4279-8bde-efad0850b207","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"8408964a-e061-427c-8e14-a17c7319129b","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"42ab4196-5eaa-43fd-b00c-eb1f4fcc338e","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"ec9c792d-cef5-483c-95eb-d36acc040a87","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"e5527363-c5ab-4f44-9d7e-667b261ff3ec","title":"Chapter